---
layout: base.njk
home: true
bodyClass: home
---

{%- macro weft(cls) -%}
<svg class="hero__weft {{ cls }}" viewBox="0 0 1200 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  {{ caller() }}
</svg>
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set w1 = "M0,40 C260,22 470,62 760,42 S1080,26 1200,40" -%}
{%- set w2 = "M0,63 C230,80 560,36 830,60 S1090,74 1200,58" -%}
{%- set w3 = "M0,51 C190,42 400,72 640,52 S990,34 1200,56" -%}

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero__inner">
  <h1 class="hero__name">
    {% call weft("hero__weft--under") %}
      <path class="w w1" d="{{ w1 }}" pathLength="1"/><path class="w w2" d="{{ w2 }}" pathLength="1"/><path class="w w3" d="{{ w3 }}" pathLength="1"/>
    {% endcall %}
    <span class="hero__word">Woven Web</span>
    {% call weft("hero__weft--over hero__weft--odd") %}
      <path class="w w1" d="{{ w1 }}" pathLength="1"/>
      <path class="w w3" d="{{ w3 }}" pathLength="1"/>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call weft("hero__weft--over hero__weft--even") %}
      <path class="w w2" d="{{ w2 }}" pathLength="1"/>
    {% endcall %}
  </h1>
  <p class="hero__lab">community research lab</p>
  <p class="hero__tagline">Weaving education, arts, and technology in service of life.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="sec" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-h">
  <h2 class="sec__title" id="who-h">Who we are</h2>
  <div class="sec__body prose">
    <p class="prose__lead">Woven Web is a community research lab. We are fostering connected cultures, developing systems in support of life, and nurturing the intersection of education, arts, and technology.</p>
    <p>We are perhaps easiest to understand through our relationships — through the organizations and initiatives we are in collaboration with, and through the work we are doing together. We are rooted in Boulder, Colorado and woven into something larger.</p>
    <p class="prose__turn">The name says something true about our orientation: not <em>weaving</em> web, but <em>woven</em> web — recognizing the state of already being woven. The connections are already here. Our work is learning to see them, tend them, and build on them.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--cohere" id="cohere" aria-labelledby="cohere-h">
  <h2 class="sec__title" id="cohere-h">COhere Boulder</h2>
  <div class="sec__body cohere">
    <figure class="cohere__quote">
      <blockquote><p>An ongoing community weaving process creating resilience through connection.</p></blockquote>
      <figcaption><a href="https://cohereboulder.org">cohereboulder.org</a></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ol class="cohere__years" aria-label="Gatherings">
      <li>October 2024</li>
      <li>October 2025</li>
      <li>October 2026</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="earthwards" aria-labelledby="earthwards-h">
  <h2 class="sec__title" id="earthwards-h">Earthwards</h2>
  <div class="sec__body prose">
    <p>A project centering art and invitations to deepen our connections with the wild ones we share this land with.</p>
  </div>
</section>

