<section class="sec" id="relationships" aria-labelledby="rel-h">
  <h2 class="sec__title" id="rel-h">Our relationships</h2>
  <div class="sec__body relationships">

    <article class="relationship">
      <h3>Spirit of the Front Range</h3>
      <p>A newly forming 501(c)(3) focused on fostering a more connected bioregional network across the Front Range. We are closely partnered in building the infrastructure of belonging for this region.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="relationship">
      <h3>RegenHub &amp; Techne</h3>
      <p>A co-working and venture cooperative in downtown Boulder where much of our work lives and breathes. The Hub is a node — a place where builders, thinkers, and community weavers find each other.</p>
      <p class="relationship__links"><a href="https://regenhub.xyz">regenhub.xyz</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="relationship">
      <h3>ATLAS Institute</h3>
      <p>CU Boulder's ATLAS Institute, working at the intersection of technology, arts, and integral learning.</p>
      <p class="relationship__links"><a href="https://www.colorado.edu/atlas">colorado.edu/atlas</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="relationship">
      <h3>Naropa University</h3>
      <p>Naropa University, working at the intersection of contemplative practice, arts, and integral learning. Its proximity to ATLAS is not coincidental; we are working to foster the culture that can emerge between them.</p>
      <p class="relationship__links"><a href="https://www.naropa.edu">naropa.edu</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="relationship">
      <h3>Climate Justice Hive</h3>
      <p>The Boulder County Climate Justice Hive is committed to developing better community organizing tools and online technology to work across borders and foster more robust partnerships. Its Boulder.Earth site keeps a community calendar of climate, culture and justice events across the county.</p>
      <p class="relationship__links"><a href="https://climatejusticehive.org">climatejusticehive.org</a><a href="https://boulder.earth/calendar">boulder.earth calendar</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="relationship">
      <h3>Cool Boulder</h3>
      <p>A city-sponsored initiative working to build a network of partners, from residents to non-profits to businesses, who invest in nature-based solutions to support the health and well-being of our community in the face of climate change.</p>
      <p class="relationship__links"><a href="https://coolboulder.org">coolboulder.org</a></p>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="newsletter" aria-labelledby="news-h">
  <h2 class="sec__title" id="news-h">Newsletter</h2>
  <div class="sec__body">
    <p>We publish a newsletter weaving together what's happening in our community — events, ideas, and dispatches from the work.</p>
    <p><a href="https://wovenweb.beehiiv.com/subscribe" class="action">Subscribe</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="connect" aria-labelledby="connect-h">
  <h2 class="sec__title" id="connect-h">Connect</h2>
  <div class="sec__body">
    <p>If this work resonates — if you're a potential funder, collaborator, or fellow traveler — we'd love to hear from you.</p>
    <p class="connect__email"><a href="mailto:hello@wovenweb.org">hello@wovenweb.org</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
